  "details": "Since [VRChat 2026.2.2p1](https://docs.vrchat.com/docs/vrchat-202622p1), the region icon was unmerged from the Instance Population icon/tooltip and now has an incorrect tooltip.\n\n1. Open instance details.\n\n2. Hover cursor over the region icon and notice the tooltip is incorrect (\"Region and Instance Population\").\n\n3. Hover cursor over the instance population tooltip and notice it uses a different but correct tooltip (\"Instance Population\").\n\nExpected result: \"Region\" tooltip on the region icon.\n\nActual result: \"Region and Instance Population\" tooltip on the region icon.",
